---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Washington Clean Energy Coalition"
  description="An all-volunteer nonprofit advocating for clean-energy solutions that reduce costs, increase reliability, and mitigate pollution in Washington State."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-dark sm:text-5xl">
      Let's get this transition right.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Washington's clean energy aspirations have been amazing. We passed
      landmark legislation like the Climate Commitment Act and Clean Energy
      Transformation Act. We were inspired by a climate-focused governor. Big
      corporations like Microsoft and Amazon had ambitious sustainability plans.
      The cost of clean energy technologies continued to plummet.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed">
      Now we face significant challenges. Data centers demand huge quantities of
      electricity that have begun to weaken commitments to clean energy.
      Corporations are turning to expensive solutions like nuclear and gas to
      fill the gap. Consultants claim the Pacific Northwest will have no choice
      but to burn huge quantities of gas to fulfill demand.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed">
      Washington Clean Energy Coalition rejects these short-sighted conclusions.
      Instead, we advocate for solutions that reduce financial burdens on
      consumers and taxpayers, increase reliability, and eliminate pollution and
      other environmental harms. Our members are all volunteers who care about
      consumers, the environment, and future generations.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a
        href="/what-we-do"
        class="rounded-md bg-brand-dark px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand"
        >What we do</a
      >
      <a
        href="/who-we-are"
        class="rounded-md border border-brand-dark px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-brand-dark transition-colors hover:bg-brand-dark hover:text-white"
        >Who we are</a
      >
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="rounded-md border border-brand-dark px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-brand-dark transition-colors hover:bg-brand-dark hover:text-white"
        >Get involved</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
